}}'''OJ''' was a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Chroma Box]]. OJ was soon deleted from the game after [[Nikilis]] redesigned the [[Chroma Box]] into the [[Rainbow Box]].

==Appearance==
The blade of this knife is colored a bright orange, while the guard is lime green. In addition to the colors of the blade, the handle is a solid black color. 

==Trivia==
*Its original design was [[Fanta]].
*This, along with the other knives from the [[Chroma Box]], was removed from all players’ [[Inventory|inventories]].
*OJ stands for '''Orange Juice.'''
